  "notes": "Researched from public nicorgas.com pages only (the Southern Company customer portal sign-in is not described publicly). All listed payment methods are free: My Account (bank or card), guest payment, Pay on the Go text-to-pay, AutoPay, phone and in person. AutoPay debits a bank account or card on the due date and may take one or two billing cycles to start. Future-dated payments can be scheduled up to 30 days ahead. A valid email is required to register; the sign-in identifier and MFA are not documented (family defaults kept). Stopping service uses an online Stop Services form (address, stop date, ID details), up to 48 hours to process; same-day requests are not possible. Payment arrangements are offered for past-due balances but the online channel is not stated, so the family default is kept.",
