  "help": [
    {
      "slug": "pay-your-bill",
      "title": "Payment options",
      "mode": "append",
      "topic": "payments",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Every way to pay Nicor Gas is free: My Account (bank account or card), a guest payment without signing in, Pay on the Go (call 888-642-6748 to get a secure text link), AutoPay, the phone line at 888-642-6748 on weekdays from 7 a.m. to 7 p.m., or in person with a check or money order.",
        "Mailed payments go to Nicor Gas, PO Box 5407, Carol Stream, IL 60197-5407; include your payment stub."
      ],
      "source": "https://www.nicorgas.com/residential/billingandpaymentoptions/paymentoptions.html"
    },
    {
      "slug": "autopay",
      "title": "AutoPay",
      "topic": "autopay",
      "paragraphs": [
        "AutoPay takes your bill amount from your bank account or credit/debit card on the due date each month, with no convenience fee.",
        "It can take a billing cycle or two to start after you enroll, so keep paying as usual until your bill shows AutoPay. To change the account used, log in and edit your payment option."
      ],
      "source": "https://www.nicorgas.com/residential/billingandpaymentoptions/paymentoptions.html"
    },
    {
      "slug": "scheduled-payments",
      "title": "Scheduling a payment",
      "topic": "payments",
      "paragraphs": [
        "You can schedule a payment up to 30 days in the future. Until the scheduled date you can edit the amount or date, or delete it.",
        "A scheduled payment does not stop collection activity on a past-due balance."
      ],
      "source": "https://www.nicorgas.com/residential/manageyouraccount/online-bill-pay-faqs.html"
    },
    {
      "slug": "payment-assistance",
      "title": "Bill payment assistance",
      "topic": "assistance",
      "paragraphs": [
        "If you are behind, you may be able to set up a payment arrangement that gives you more time; call 888-642-6748.",
        "The Budget Plan spreads your gas costs into monthly installments. LIHEAP helps income-eligible households with winter heating costs through local Community Action Agencies, and the Sharing Program, run with The Salvation Army, offers bill payment grants."
      ],
      "source": "https://www.nicorgas.com/residential/billingandpaymentoptions/bill-payment-assistance.html"
    },
    {
      "slug": "cancel-service",
      "title": "Stop service",
      "topic": "account",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Use the online Stop Services form with your service address, the date you want service stopped and your identification details, or call 888-642-6748.",
        "Requests can take up to 48 hours to process. Same-day and past-dated stops are not accepted. If you are moving within the area, use the Transfer Service form instead."
      ],
      "source": "https://www.nicorgas.com/residential/manageyouraccount/start-stop-transfer-service/stop-services.html"
    }
  ],
